Package: deepn
Title: Dynamic Enrichment for Evaluation of Protein Networks
Version: 1.5-4
Date: 2017-05-25
Author: Patrick Breheny
Maintainer: Patrick Breheny <patrick-breheny@uiowa.edu>
Description: This is the accompanying R package for the DEEPN project <https://github.com/emptyewer/DEEPN>.
  Version pinned to 1.5-x (not 1.6-0) because inst/model/sModel2.jag - the
  file that actually determines this package's statistical output - was
  deliberately reverted to its 1.5-2 state (byte-identical) to remove the
  psi parameter added in 1.6-0. Bumped to 1.5-4 for a second, independent
  local fix: R/overdisp.R and R/applyFilter.R no longer let a bait
  contaminate Vector's own "Baseline"/"Selected" dispersion estimates.
  See README.md for the full rationale on both changes.
BugReports: http://github.com/pbreheny/deepn/issues
License: GPL-3
SystemRequirements: JAGS (http://mcmc-jags.sourceforge.net)
Depends: rjags, runjags, edgeR
